  "title": "Global Indemnity Group, LLC Reports Financial Results for the three and six months ended June 30, 2026",
  "summary": "Net income increased to $11.1 million, or $0.76 per share, growth of 8% for the quarter driven by a 53.8% loss ratio. Belmont Core gross written premiums grew 7% for the quarter. WILMINGTON, Del., Aug. 05, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - Global Indemnity Group, LLC (Nasdaq: GBLI) (the \"Company\") today reported financial results for the three and six months ended June 30, 2026. For the three months ended June 30, 2026, net income was $11.1 million, or $0.76 per share, compared to $10.3 million, or $0.71",
